TIMING-27#1 Critical Warning
Invalid primary clock on hierarchical pin  
A primary clock cdc_asyn_fifo_axis_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clk_in1 is created on an inappropriate internal pin cdc_asyn_fifo_axis_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/clk_in1. It is not recommended to create a primary clock on a hierarchical pin when its driver pin has a fanout connected to multiple clock pins
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-56#1 Advisory
MMCME4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The MMCME4_ADV cell cdc_asyn_fifo_axis_i/clk_wiz_0/inst/mmcme4_adv_inst CLKIN1 or CLKIN2 pin is driven by global Clock buffer(s) cdc_asyn_fifo_axis_i/zynq_ultra_ps_e_0/inst/buffer_pl_clk_0.PL_CLK_0_BUFG and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the MMCM and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net(s) driven by the global Clock buffer(s).
Related violations: <none>


